{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 09 December 2024, the use of a room within '73 Princes Road, Feltham, TW13 4LB' as an office for chauffeur booking service would not result in a change of use of part of/ or the whole of the dwellinghouse and is therefore lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\nThe use of the room within the existing dwellinghouse to operate as an office for mini-cab booking service, with no external alterations; no picking up or dropping off of customers at the site or comings and goings of drivers to the premises does represent a change of use of part or whole of the property and therefore planning permission is not required\r\n"
  ],
